                Gas push mowers typically run 65 to 72 pounds, battery push mowers 45 to 55 pounds, corded electric mowers around 29 pounds, and manual reel mowers about 19 pounds. The 20 to 30 pound difference between gas and battery is the single biggest factor in how tiring a mower is to push over a full session.
