              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Are reel mowers worth it?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                On a lawn under roughly 2,000 square feet that gets cut on a regular schedule, yes. They produce the cleanest cut of any mower type, weigh almost nothing, cost very little, and need no fuel or charging. They cannot cut tall or overgrown grass at all, so missing two weeks of spring growth makes one temporarily useless.
